#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.Component.get_state:3 of
msgid ""
"A component is considered installed when its state is one of: CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_UPDATED, "
"CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_UP_TO_DATE, or CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_RUN."
msgstr ""
"구성 요소의 상태가 CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_UPDATED, CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_UP_TO_DATE, CEF_COMPONENT_STATE_RUN 중"
" 하나이면 설치된 것으로 간주합니다."

#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.Component.get_state:7 of
