msgstr "``task_id``\\ 의 작업에 대한 정보를 가져옵니다."

#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.TaskManager.get_task_info:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the information about the task was successfully retrieved and ``False`` if "
"the ``task_id`` is invalid or the method was called from the incorrect thread."
msgstr ""
"작업 정보를 성공적으로 가져왔으면 ``True``\\ 를, ``task_id``\\ 가 유효하지 않거나 잘못된 스레드에서 메서드를 호출했으면 ``False``\\ 를 "
"반환합니다."

#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.TaskManager.get_task_info:7 of
msgid "Invalid or the method was called from the incorrect thread."
