#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.Button.get_state:3 of
msgid "The current display state of the Button."
msgstr "Button의 현재 표시 상태."

#: ../../docstring cefweaver._cefweaver.Button.set_accessible_name:1
#: cefweaver._cefweaver.Textfield.set_accessible_name:1 of
msgid "Set the accessible name that will be exposed to assistive technology (AT)."
